WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
In Cuzco, the Inca kept the
mummies of their past rulers,

2
00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.800
and honored them as living presences.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:12.130
In Ethiopia, from 1270, kings claimed
descent from King Solomon and the Queen

4
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.270
of Sheba.

5
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:18.120
In Kano, Muhammad Rumfa promoted
Islamic law and scholarship.

6
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:23.040
Emperors, sultans and kings all
claimed heaven was on their side.

7
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.290
How did they make people believe it?

8
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:30.090
In this mission, you'll compare rulers
from Song China to the Mughal Empire.

9
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.850
Then you'll see why some rulers
welcomed people of other faiths,

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.890
while others drove them out.

11
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.590
Your mission: find out how rulers made
people believe that heaven was on their

12
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.330
side.
